# TS-first script authoring (Issue #837)

- Author every **net-new script file** under `scripts/**` in **TypeScript/Node**.
- legacy shell is frozen during the migration. Add a net-new `.ps1` only when the
  task spec contains an explicit written justification for why TypeScript/Node is
  unsuitable for that specific file.
- This applies only to new files. Existing `.ps1` files and migration-defined
  wrappers/shims are owned by Waves A and B (Issues #830 and #831).

Canonical freeze: [`docs/architecture.md`](../../docs/architecture.md#ts-first-script-authoring-freeze).
